# Client / Next.js Public Site

## Routing

Pages Router (`client/pages/`). Do NOT use App Router. Static pages use `getStaticProps` with `revalidate: 60` (ISR). Transactional pages (`/booking`, `/quiz`) use SSR.

## i18n

`next-i18next` with `serverSideTranslations`. Default locale: `ru`, available: `['ru', 'en', 'am']`. Always include `serverSideTranslations(locale, ['common'])` in `getStaticProps`/`getServerSideProps`.

```tsx
import { serverSideTranslations } from 'next-i18next/serverSideTranslations';
import { useTranslation } from 'next-i18next';
```

## Layout

Wrap page content with `<Layout title={...}>`. Layout includes `<Header />` and `<Footer />`.

## API Calls

Use `apiFetch<T>(path, init?)` from `../lib/api`. It prepends `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` and returns `ApiResponse<T>`. In `getStaticProps`, wrap in try/catch so the build succeeds when the API is offline.

## Components

Functional components in `client/components/`. TypeScript, explicit prop types. No state management library — keep state local or fetch in `getStaticProps`.

## DB Content Fallback

Pages fetch content from `GET /api/content/:lang` at build time. If a field is missing, fall back to the i18n translation key (`t('...')`).
